<title>USA: CompUSA Inc Q1 same-store sales up 7.2 pct.</title>
<headline>CompUSA Inc Q1 same-store sales up 7.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>CompUSA Inc said its comparable store sales rose 7.2 percent in its fiscal first quarter ended September 28.</p>
<p>The company made the comment in announcing its first quarter results. Sales for the quarter rose 26.7 percent, to $991 million from $782 million a year earlier. Earnings rose to $0.31 per share from $0.15.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
